The AWS Marketplace listings these examples call serve Qwen3-Reranker models (Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B, -4B and -8B)
by Alibaba Cloud's Qwen team, published at https://huggingface.co/Qwen under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The model files are modified: Transcendent Logic converted Qwen's published weights into TL Engine's own model file
format. The tokenizer and configuration files are Qwen's, unmodified. "Qwen" is a name of its owner and is used here only to say which models
are served.

TL Engine, the inference engine in the model package's container, is not part of this repository.
